flowchart LR
  SIG[SIG simulator / source system]
  PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>sig.transactions<br/>sig.audit_logs<br/>mw.attested_index<br/>mw.alert_index)]
  API[Node.js API<br/>API key / JWT]
  MAP[Adapters + canonical mapper<br/>validation + SHA-256]
  GW[RoleGatewayClient<br/>writer / reader / auditor]
  PEER[Fabric Gateway to peer0 Org1<br/>localhost:7051]
  CC[agnostictrace chaincode<br/>Org1MSP role attribute]
  LEDGER[(Fabric ledger<br/>event payload, sourceHash,<br/>blockchainHash, alerts, report hashes)]
  AUDIT[AuditEngine<br/>rules R1-R5]
  SIGN[Ed25519 alert signer]
  PDF[PDF builder / local reports directory]
  CLIENT[Reader / auditor clients]

  SIG -->|business rows| PG
  CLIENT --> API
  API -->|POST /ingest: poll JDBC| PG
  API -->|POST /ingest/webhook| MAP
  PG -->|unindexed source rows| MAP
  MAP -->|canonical payload + sourceHash| GW
  GW --> PEER --> CC --> LEDGER
  CC -->|commit result / txId| GW
  GW -->|recordAttestation after commit| PG

  API -->|audit request| AUDIT
  PG -->|period index rows| AUDIT
  AUDIT -->|evaluate getAttestedEvent| GW
  LEDGER -->|full stored payload| GW
  AUDIT --> SIGN -->|createAuditAlert| GW
  GW -->|record alert after commit| PG

  API -->|generate report| PDF
  PG -->|correlations and alert index| PDF
  GW -->|get attested payloads| PDF
  PDF -->|PDF written locally; SHA-256| GW
  GW -->|certifyReport: hash only| LEDGER

  API -->|verify: caller supplies payload| GW
  GW -->|verifyEventIntegrity| LEDGER
